in="01:06.923" end="01:07.249">然</span><span begin="01:07.249" end="01:07.742">都</span><span begin="01:07.742" end="01:08.559">明</span><span begin="01:08.559" end="01:09.806">白</span></p><p begin="01:11.994" end="01:16.412" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13"><span begin="01:11.994" end="01:12.322">可</span><span begin="01:12.322" end="01:12.901">是呀</span><span begin="01:12.901" end="01:13.458">只有</span><span begin="01:13.458" end="01:14.002">你曾</span><span begin="01:14.002" end="01:14.555">陪我</span><span begin="01:14.555" end="01:15.103">在最</span><span begin="01:15.103" end="01:15.638">初的</span><span begin="01:15.638" end="01:15.894">地</span><span begin="01:15.894" end="01:16.412">方</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以 现在</span></p><p begin="01:16.531" end="01:20.751" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14"><span begin="01:16.531" end="01:16.772">只</span><span begin="01:16.772" end="01:17.273">有你</span><span begin="01:17.273" end="01:17.796">才能</span><span begin="01:17.796" end="01:18.424">了解</span><span begin="01:18.424" end="01:18.936">我要</span><span begin="01:18.936" end="01:19.386">的夢</span><span begin="01:19.386" end="01:20.029">從來</span><span begin="01:20.029" end="01:20.282">不</span><span begin="01:20.282" end="01:20.751">大</span></p><p begin="01:20.847" end="01:25.041" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15"><span begin="01:20.847" end="01:21.095">我</span><span begin="01:21.095" end="01:21.656">們沒</span><span begin="01:21.656" end="01:22.190">有在</span><span begin="01:22.190" end="01:22.720">一起</span><span begin="01:22.720" end="01:23.256">至少</span><span begin="01:23.256" end="01:23.784">還像</span><span begin="01:23.784" end="01:24.394">情侶</span><span begin="01:24.394" end="01:24.699">一</span><span begin="01:24.699" end="01:25.041">樣</span></p><p begin="01:25.154" end="01:29.421" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16"><span begin="01:25.154" end="01:25.471">我</span><span begin="01:25.471" end="01:26.014">痛的</span><span begin="01:26.014" end="01:26.512">瘋的</span><sp